<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83458" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾰκοῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦντος</span>,
			ὁ, voc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theodos.
					<u>Can.</u>
					p.3
				</span></i>
			 H.:—
				contr.
			 from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακόεις</span>, <i>flat
				cake</i> (perh. <i>shaped like the mallow-seed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phan.Hist.
				29
			</span></i>), freq. in Com., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦντος κύκλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1125
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				22
			</span></i> (pl., hex.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἄρτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					14.645d
				</span></i>
			: also resolved <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακόεις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.155
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Theodorid.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the seed of the mallow</i>, which seeds children call
				<i>cheeses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phan.Hist.
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.113
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
